meta {
  name: Create Order
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "shipping_address": "string",
    "shipping_city": "string",
    "shipping_postal_code": "EXAMPLE10",
    "shipping_country": "US",
    "items": [
      {
        "product_id": 1,
        "quantity": 1
      }
    ],
    "shipping_method_id": 1
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** Public (no token)

**Request body** `OrderCreate`:
  - `shipping_address`: string (required)
  - `shipping_city`: string (required)
  - `shipping_postal_code`: string (required)
  - `shipping_country`: string (required)
  - `notes`: string|null
  - `items`: array[OrderItemCreate] (required)
  - `currency`: string
  - `shipping_method_id`: integer (required)
  - `coupon_code`: string|null
  - `guest_email`: string|null
  - `locale`: string|null

**Responses:** 201, 422
}
